{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24593","headline":"亭西墙下伊渠水中置石激流潺湲成韵颇有幽趣以诗记之 · 白居易","name":"亭西墙下伊渠水中置石激流潺湲成韵颇有幽趣以诗记之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵌巉嵩石峭，皎洁伊流清。\n立爲远峰势，激作寒玉声。\n夹岸罗密树，面滩开小亭。\n忽疑严子濑，流入洛阳城。\n是时羣动息，风静微月明。\n高枕夜悄悄，满耳秋泠泠。\n终日临大道，何人知此情。\n此情苟自惬，亦不要人听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}